infinite-patch 1
# FMDX Rhodes Tine E-Piano Synth
node 1 Notes Note Sequencer
  id notes
  pos 0 1024
  f rateBeats 0.5
  i steps 16
  i note0 48
  i note1 55
  i note2 60
  i note3 64
  i note4 53
  i note5 60
